  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "企業租稅策略",
    "sub_ename": "CORPORATE TAX PLANNING",
    "describe_ch": "本課程主要考量企業整體財務與營運結構下，探討租稅如何影響企業做成決策以及對企業價值之影響。本課程發展企業租稅規劃的基本架構，並運用這些工具在企業各種的租稅規劃情境上。\r\n",
    "describe_eh": "This course is designed to provide a framework for understanding how taxes affect decision making and firm's value which comes from integrating the tax law with the fundamentals of corporate finance and operating structure. The course begins by developing a conceptual framework for analyzing tax planning transactions and then applies these tools to various tax planning scenarios.\r\n",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 3.0
  },
